+SCENARIO_BEGIN Test cachedb, validator and serve expired.
+
+; K.ROOT-SERVERS.NET.
+RANGE_BEGIN 0 400
+	ADDRESS 193.0.14.129
+ENTRY_BEGIN
+MATCH opcode qtype qname
+ADJUST copy_id
+REPLY QR NOERROR
+SECTION QUESTION
