+
+ENTRY_BEGIN
+MATCH opcode subdomain
+ADJUST copy_id copy_query
+REPLY QR NOERROR
+SECTION QUESTION
+foo.com. IN NS
+SECTION AUTHORITY
+foo.com. IN NS ns.example.com.
