+STEP 130 QUERY
+ENTRY_BEGIN
+REPLY RD
+SECTION QUESTION
+www.example.com. IN A
+ENTRY_END
+
+STEP 140 CHECK_ANSWER
+ENTRY_BEGIN
+MATCH all ttl
+REPLY QR RD RA NOERROR
+SECTION QUESTION
+www.example.com. IN A
+SECTION ANSWER
+www.example.com. 10 IN A 1.2.3.4
